  "releaseNotes": "Add Lucifer reflection helpers and update calls:\n      - Introduce reflection helper wrappers on the Lucifer API (GetCleanAssemblies, GetTypesWithAttribute, GetTypesAssignableTo, GetMethodsWithAttribute, GetStaticMethodsWithAttribute, GetStaticPropertiesWithAttribute) and replace direct FastReflection calls across the codebase.\n      - Updated usages in RouteHandler, LuciferCMD, LuciferConfig, LuciferHost and SimulationManager to call Lucifer.* variants and removed now-unused LuciferCore.Core imports where applicable.\n      - This centralizes reflection utilities and keeps reflection access through the Lucifer entrypoint.",
